The release exe lives here: `save.bat build` copies it out of target\release\.

It sits in the repo rather than in target\ because target\ is a build
directory — `cargo clean` empties it — and because the app keeps its state
beside its executable. Running dist\TelegramExporter.exe therefore puts
dist\TelegramExporterData\ and dist\Exports\ next to it, which is what makes
the folder portable: copy dist\ anywhere and it works, credentials and all.

Everything in here except this file is gitignored, for that last reason.
